primaryOutcomes.description:
DLTs are defined as CD73/AXL.HypoSti.CAR-T cell therapy related adverse events within the first 28 days that meet the following criteria:

* Grade 4 CRS or grade 3 CRS that is not resolved to grade 2 or lower within 2 weeks;
* Grade 3 ICANS lasting for ≥7 days or Grade 4 ICANS;
* Any other Grade ≥4 and Grade 3 AEs related to the CD73/AXL.HypoSti.CAR-T infusion that lasts for ≥14 days, except hematology toxicity.
